{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/2012763/block/singleImage/3263761/df/01M73H9THQ8B9GBMHR0KXRJT9W.jpg?updatedAt=1794341533\"/><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/2012763/block/singleImage/3263763/df/01M73H9TG3P3C5GHVE7P69E298.jpg?updatedAt=1794341533\"/><p>圍方今個冬日推出多項人氣主題活動及新品牌進駐，結合韓流、動漫及購物體驗。韓國人氣女團LE SSERAFIM期間限定店即日起至11月29日進駐圍方，發售演唱會及專輯系列官方周邊產品，並設多個主題打卡位供粉絲朝聖。動漫迷則可留意即日至23日舉行的全港首個「MUSE Pop Fest powered by 動漫聯動」快閃店，集合36個人氣動漫IP及逾900款精品，包括《HUNTER x HUNTER》、《鬼滅之刃》、《DAN DA DAN》等作品，現場更有大型角色裝置及限定商品登場。配合活動，圍方推出「Cosplay Unlock」企劃，顧客以動漫角色造型到場可享多間玩樂及玩具精品商戶專屬優惠。</p><p>此外，商場於11月至12月期間引進逾30個新品牌，包括日本生活雜貨品牌3COINS、香港Pokémon TCG卡牌專門店Cardzoku、本地手袋品牌Cafuné及泰國睡衣品牌Sleeping Cloud香港首店等。</p><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/2012763/block/singleImage/3263764/df/01M73H9TQPEC4BZ5X3HRF2SVYT.jpg?updatedAt=1794341533\"/></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T21:47:39.985793+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":407,"images":3,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T20:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T01:40:40.324688+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T21:40:57.903879+00:00","content_hash":"11b0b649fd71d2e4b15e8f71dfc15b70680b897f20b957c733e43739151cfcb8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T21:47:39.985793+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}